sequenceDiagram
    participant User as Data Scientist
    participant Dashboard as ODH Dashboard
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API
    participant KServeWH as KServe Webhook
    participant KServeCtrl as KServe Controller
    participant StorageInit as Storage Initializer
    participant ModelServer as Model Server<br/>vLLM/OVMS/MLServer
    participant ODHModelCtrl as odh-model-controller
    participant DSGW as data-science-gateway
    participant KubeAuth as kube-auth-proxy
    participant Client as External Client

    Note over User,Client: Workflow 1: Model Deployment via Dashboard

    User->>DSGW: Login via browser (HTTPS/443)
    DSGW->>KubeAuth: ext_authz filter
    KubeAuth-->>DSGW: OAuth session established
    DSGW-->>Dashboard: Authenticated request
    Dashboard-->>User: Platform UI

    User->>Dashboard: Create InferenceService
    Dashboard->>K8sAPI: Submit InferenceService CR
    K8sAPI->>KServeWH: Validate + default CR
    KServeWH-->>K8sAPI: Admission approved
    K8sAPI-->>KServeCtrl: InferenceService created

    KServeCtrl->>KServeCtrl: Select ServingRuntime<br/>Create Deployment spec
    KServeCtrl->>K8sAPI: Create Deployment with<br/>init container + model server
    Note over StorageInit: Init container starts
    StorageInit->>StorageInit: Download model from<br/>S3/GCS/Azure/OCI/HuggingFace
    StorageInit-->>ModelServer: Model files on shared volume

    ODHModelCtrl->>K8sAPI: Watch InferenceService
    ODHModelCtrl->>K8sAPI: Create HTTPRoute, NetworkPolicy,<br/>RBAC, ServiceMonitor

    Client->>DSGW: POST /v1/models/my-model:predict<br/>HTTPS/443
    DSGW->>KubeAuth: ext_authz authentication
    KubeAuth-->>DSGW: Authenticated + token forwarding
    DSGW->>ModelServer: Route to inference pod
    ModelServer-->>DSGW: Prediction response
    DSGW-->>Client: JSON response (HTTPS)

    User->>Dashboard: View model metrics
    Dashboard->>K8sAPI: Query InferenceService status
    Dashboard-->>User: Model status + metrics

