sequenceDiagram
    participant Admin as Platform Admin
    participant MaaSCtrl as MaaS Controller
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API
    participant MaaSAPI as maas-api
    participant PG as PostgreSQL
    participant APIClient as API Client
    participant MaaSGW as maas-default-gateway
    participant PraxisPre as praxis-extproc<br/>pre-auth BBR
    participant Authorino as Kuadrant/Authorino
    participant PraxisPost as praxis-extproc<br/>post-auth IPP
    participant AIGW as ai-gateway-controller
    participant ExtProvider as External AI Provider

    Note over Admin,ExtProvider: Workflow 2: MaaS External Model Access

    Admin->>K8sAPI: Create AITenant CR with<br/>model access policies
    K8sAPI-->>MaaSCtrl: AITenant reconciliation

    MaaSCtrl->>K8sAPI: Create tenant namespace
    MaaSCtrl->>K8sAPI: Create MaasTenantConfig
    MaaSCtrl->>K8sAPI: Create HTTPRoutes for<br/>maas-default-gateway
    MaaSCtrl->>K8sAPI: Create Kuadrant AuthPolicy
    MaaSCtrl->>MaaSAPI: Initialize API key infrastructure
    MaaSAPI->>PG: Store tenant API keys

    Note over APIClient: User obtains API key (sk-oai-*)

    APIClient->>MaaSGW: POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>Authorization: Bearer sk-oai-*

    MaaSGW->>PraxisPre: ExtProc pre-auth (fail-open)
    PraxisPre->>PraxisPre: Extract model name from body
    PraxisPre-->>MaaSGW: Set x-model-name routing header

    MaaSGW->>Authorino: API key validation
    Authorino->>MaaSAPI: HTTP callback<br/>/internal/v1/api-keys/validate
    MaaSAPI->>PG: Lookup API key
    PG-->>MaaSAPI: Key valid + tenant info
    MaaSAPI-->>Authorino: Validation result
    Authorino->>Authorino: Strip Authorization header
    Authorino-->>MaaSGW: Inject X-MaaS-Username,<br/>X-MaaS-Group, X-MaaS-Subscription

    MaaSGW->>PraxisPost: ExtProc post-auth (fail-closed)
    PraxisPost->>PraxisPost: Provider resolution +<br/>payload transformation

    Note over AIGW: ai-gateway-controller has created<br/>per-model HTTPRoutes + Istio ServiceEntry<br/>with TLS origination

    PraxisPost-->>MaaSGW: Transformed request
    MaaSGW->>ExtProvider: Proxied inference request<br/>HTTPS with TLS origination
    ExtProvider-->>MaaSGW: Model response
    MaaSGW-->>APIClient: Response (HTTPS)

