sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as API Client
    participant InfGW as Inference Gateway<br/>Envoy
    participant EPP as llm-d-router EPP<br/>ext-proc
    participant Sidecar as llm-d-routing-sidecar
    participant Prefill as Prefill Worker<br/>vLLM
    participant NIXL as KV-Cache Transfer<br/>NIXL/RDMA
    participant Decode as Decode Worker<br/>vLLM
    participant KVCache as llm-d-kv-cache<br/>Scheduler

    Note over Client,KVCache: Workflow 3: LLM-D Disaggregated Inference

    Client->>InfGW: POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>OpenAI-compatible request
    InfGW->>EPP: ext-proc endpoint selection

    EPP->>EPP: Score endpoints via plugin chain:<br/>1. prefix-cache affinity<br/>2. inflight-load balancing<br/>3. token-load balancing
    EPP-->>InfGW: Selected decode pod endpoint

    InfGW->>Sidecar: Route to selected decode pod
    Note over Sidecar: Intercepts request on decode pod

    Sidecar->>KVCache: Check KV-cache availability
    KVCache-->>Sidecar: Cache miss — prefill needed

    Sidecar->>Prefill: Orchestrate prefill handoff
    Note over Prefill: Process input tokens<br/>Generate KV-cache blocks
    Prefill->>NIXL: Transfer KV-cache blocks<br/>via RDMA or shared storage
    NIXL-->>Decode: KV-cache available on decode pod

    Note over Decode: Generate output tokens<br/>using transferred KV-cache
    Decode-->>Sidecar: Token stream
    Sidecar-->>InfGW: Streaming response
    InfGW-->>Client: SSE token stream

