sequenceDiagram
    participant User as Data Scientist
    participant Dashboard as ODH Dashboard
    participant DSPAPI as DS Pipelines API Server
    participant ArgoWF as Argo Workflows
    participant PodStep as Pipeline Step Pod
    participant MLMetadata as ml-metadata
    participant S3 as S3 Storage
    participant KServe as KServe

    Note over User,KServe: Workflow 4: Data Science Pipeline Execution

    User->>Dashboard: Navigate to Pipelines UI
    User->>DSPAPI: Submit pipeline run<br/>via Dashboard or SDK

    DSPAPI->>DSPAPI: Validate pipeline definition
    DSPAPI->>ArgoWF: Create Argo Workflow CR

    ArgoWF->>PodStep: Step 1: Data preprocessing pod
    PodStep->>S3: Download training data
    S3-->>PodStep: Raw data
    PodStep->>PodStep: Transform + validate data
    PodStep->>S3: Upload processed dataset
    PodStep->>MLMetadata: Record artifact lineage<br/>gRPC

    ArgoWF->>PodStep: Step 2: Model training pod
    PodStep->>S3: Download processed dataset
    PodStep->>PodStep: Train model
    PodStep->>S3: Upload model artifacts
    PodStep->>MLMetadata: Record training params,<br/>metrics, model artifact

    ArgoWF->>PodStep: Step 3: Model evaluation pod
    PodStep->>S3: Download model + test data
    PodStep->>PodStep: Evaluate model performance
    PodStep->>MLMetadata: Record evaluation metrics

    Note over ArgoWF: All steps completed

    ArgoWF-->>DSPAPI: Workflow completed

    User->>Dashboard: View pipeline results
    Dashboard->>DSPAPI: Query run status + artifacts
    DSPAPI->>MLMetadata: Fetch artifact lineage
    MLMetadata-->>DSPAPI: Full lineage graph
    DSPAPI-->>Dashboard: Run results + artifacts
    Dashboard-->>User: Display pipeline results,<br/>metrics, and lineage
